# Pinefall Lake Campsite -- special area, 24x18 (buffer 720/1300), ref LakeOfRage
# HOOK: a ranger-run campground on the south shore of a pine-ringed lake, where the
#   hack's "rest + watch" mechanic gets its tutorial. "Pinefall" is the waterfall
#   that drops from the NE cliff (88/8a channel, 8e/8f falls, 90/91 foot) into the lake.
# CAMP VOCABULARY (no tent tiles needed):
#   7c 7d pair = canvas tent pad (tan canvas between two poles; solid). Two pitches.
#   7b = log-edged pit, used as the campfire pit between the pitches (solid).
#   48 49 4a picket fence = campground boundary, gate gap on the main road.
#   2c 2d/2e 2f = log cabin (Lake of Rage house) as the Ranger Station: PC + waypoint
#   for the redesigned blackout, sells Bedroll/Tent items from the design doc.
#   a3 = fishing pier (N-S walkway), 89 = E-W footbridge over the outflow stream.
# BEATS:
#   - Ranger (by the fire) explains rest + watch; first rest here is free and safe
#     because her Growlithe (SPRITE_GROWLITHE) keeps watch. After that, the normal
#     once-a-day rest with the watch-Pokemon ambush roll applies at the fire pit.
#   - Night only: Camper on the shore lane, Picnicker in the east grass (checktime
#     NITE); by day a TentCamper NPC chats instead. Fisher on the pier tip.
#   - SwimmerF in the lake (Surf). Island hidden item (Surf). Camper on the south trail.
#   - Cut tree (5b) at the west treeline opens a lakeside nook: item + hidden item
#     (an old angler's spot; a good place for a Good Rod giver later).
#   - Tall-grass pocket SW with an item ball, sign at the west entrance.
# ATTACH: W -> Lake of Rage east edge (its rows 3-7 at x=19 are grass, so a gap is
#   cheap); E -> new trail toward Route 42/Mahogany (or Orchard Road); S -> stub
#   (Orchard Road south exit). Indoor: Ranger Cabin (PC/waypoint).
# TILE GAPS: no fire/tent tiles (stand-ins above); the falls can later host a
#   Waterfall-HM secret (channel top runs to the map edge = future connection).
# SEASONS: falls/lake unchanged in winter; the pine wall goes snowy, cabin roof fine.
ref LakeOfRage
key M=71 F=72 z=68 R=6c a=88 b=8a c=8e d=8f j=90 K=91 {=79 }=7a
key P=a3 B=89 t=7c u=7d h=7b q=48 w=49 p=4a
key 1=2c 2=2d 3=2e 4=2f g=60 G=62 x=5c y=5d v=5e U=65 N=66 A=3c D=3d E=3e Q=3f X=5b
